\text{confidence} &\Rightarrow \text{good equilibrium},\\
\text{panic expectations} &\Rightarrow \text{bad equilibrium} \Rightarrow \text{bank run}.\end{aligned}$ Or, more compactly, $\text{multiple equilibria} \Rightarrow \text{scope for a bank run}.$

